## Configuration file for the indexing service
## This file contains environment variable settings for the indexing service.
## You can set these variables in your environment or use a .env file to load them.
## The coommented
## Uncomment and set the following environment variables to configure the indexing service.

## PostgreSQL connection settings for indexing service
## Das DB-Passwort wird aus dem Keyring geholt, der API-Key-Name
## kann über die Umgebungsvariable IND_PG_API_KEY konfiguriert werden (Standard: "pg-docker").
    IND_PG_HOST=localhost                   #PostgreSQL Host
#    IND_PG_PORT=5432                        #PostgreSQL Port
#    IND_PG_USER=postgres                    #PostgreSQL Username
#    IND_PG_DATABASE=postgres                #PostgreSQL Database Name
    IND_PG_SCHEMA=meipi-indexing            #PostgreSQL Schema Name
    IND_SERVER_NAME=lenox
#    IND_PG_API_KEY=pg-docker                #API-Key-Name für das DB-Passwort im Keyring

